Usage: vifstab [flags...] manpage [flags...] [operands...]

Generate the manual page explicitly.

Subcommands:
    help  Print this help message
    usage Print this usage message



`vifstab` Flags:
    --file string       (default: "/etc/fstab")   File to verify.

`manpage` Flags:
    --output string     (default: "vifstab.1")    Destination file.

Positional Arguments:
    [operands...] No positional operands are accepted.
